=== J. FINRA 5131(e)(3): covered-non-public-company financial tests ===
5131(e)(3): "Covered non-public company" means any non-public company, except for an unaffiliated charitable organization, satisfying the following criteria:
  (i) income of at least $1 million in the last fiscal year or in two of the last three fiscal years
  and shareholders' equity of at least $15 million;
  (ii) shareholders' equity of at least $30 million and a two-year operating history; or
  (iii) total assets and total revenue of at least $75 million in the latest fiscal year
  or in two of the last three fiscal years
